Description: Present camera pairs in a declared child video surface
 Read the Camera page choice, unpack with stereo-layer and pass complete views
 at their native sample size to the edition Qt video surface. Keep the original
 GStreamer sink when Enable 3D is off.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Forwarded: no
